{"2590150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Faaast Penguin", "steam_appid": 2590150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [3678380, 5131240], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stomp on your rivals and aim for 1st place!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed off into a 40-player survival race where fast-paced action and fierce strategy collide!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faaast Penguin is a survival action racing game for up to 40 players where mastering attacks and shortcuts is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>○ Stomp, Jump, and Boost Speed! The Attack That Decides the Race</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/40ba0935a7c710580e738f26b015d1cd.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/40ba0935a7c710580e738f26b015d1cd.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/40ba0935a7c710580e738f26b015d1cd.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply sliding isn't enough to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stomp on rivals and objects with an attack to boost your speed and do a big jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One split-second decision can turn a race upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your moment, leap into the air, and take the top spot at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This clash of speed, skill, and strategy is the true thrill of Faaast Penguin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ Find Shortcuts All Across the Stage!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/f0135fe99a178cddf4fbe085c40e6479.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/f0135fe99a178cddf4fbe085c40e6479.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/f0135fe99a178cddf4fbe085c40e6479.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shortcut routes are scattered throughout the courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain attacks to reach routes that would otherwise be impossible to access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail it and you'll blast past your rivals, but overdo it and you could go off course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe or go all in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your skills improve, new racing lines open up, creating a deep and rewarding racing experience that keeps getting better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯  Seize the Moment and Activate Your Ultimate!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/3320b90921dab04225e38ae5d3b02522.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/3320b90921dab04225e38ae5d3b02522.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/3320b90921dab04225e38ae5d3b02522.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Collect cans of sardines to activate your Ultimate and become invincible for a limited time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into shortcuts! Send your rivals flying. Destroy gimmicks. Catch up in the final stretch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The possibilities are endless. Analyze the situation and create a strategy that's uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ Master Each Course's Unique Gimmicks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/144425dbc270e0592709a78de2ae28b2.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/144425dbc270e0592709a78de2ae28b2.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/144425dbc270e0592709a78de2ae28b2.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master special course gimmicks and outsmart your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect water and soar through the skies in Miami, ride monkeys through the Amazon, unleash ninja skills with scrolls in Japan, and perform snowboard tricks on snowy peaks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 worlds and over 64 courses await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ Survive With Your Own Skill</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/6d625680a8f1ad3ddb1b457fb617a26f.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/6d625680a8f1ad3ddb1b457fb617a26f.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/6d625680a8f1ad3ddb1b457fb617a26f.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a 4-course survival race where only the best advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through each stage at top speed and rack up points to claim overall victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ Enjoy It Solo or With Friends</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills solo or compete against your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's solo play, party play with up to 4 players, and even custom matches with up to 40 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a cross-platform game, so you can play with anyone regardless of platform!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ Extensive Player Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/52eec466c2dd5786f5941c24307f464b.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/52eec466c2dd5786f5941c24307f464b.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/52eec466c2dd5786f5941c24307f464b.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely customize your costumes, carts, ultimate rides, and emotes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't affect performance, so rock your style and dive into the penguins' vacation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Penguin Climbers]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ The plane is leaving without you?! Time for a great escape!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/94bae7ffc195418796a2d8f7737b2d66.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/94bae7ffc195418796a2d8f7737b2d66.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/94bae7ffc195418796a2d8f7737b2d66.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a fun snowy mountain tour, a cliff collapses! It's a disaster! The penguins' desperate (or not) climb begins as they race back to the plane about to depart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb walls with an ice axe, occasionally rescuing friends with a fishing rod, and forge your way through the harsh surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to reach the summit, or challenge yourself solo for a more disciplined climb. Will you safely reunite with the tour conductor and snap a memorable photo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ To snowy mountains, jungles, and starlit skies! Explore a mysterious island.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/c587f4109fb0c10acf76a44449f421ce.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/c587f4109fb0c10acf76a44449f421ce.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/c587f4109fb0c10acf76a44449f421ce.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The penguins have arrived at the mysterious Enigma Islands, where the terrain changes daily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From giant bird nests and mysterious mech penguins to fishing spots, there are plenty of fascinating places to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, defeat enemies, and experience survival action unlike any race!   </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stomp on your rivals and aim for 1st place!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed off into a 40-player survival race where fast-paced action and fierce strategy collide!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faaast Penguin is a survival action racing game for up to 40 players where mastering attacks and shortcuts is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>○ Stomp, Jump, and Boost Speed! The Attack That Decides the Race</strong