hortcut routes are scattered throughout the courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain attacks to reach routes that would otherwise be impossible to access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail it and you'll blast past your rivals, but overdo it and you could go off course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe or go all in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your skills improve, new racing lines open up, creating a deep and rewarding racing experience that keeps getting better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯  Seize the Moment and Activate Your Ultimate!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/3320b90921dab04225e38ae5d3b02522.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/3320b90921dab04225e38ae5d3b02522.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/3320b90921dab04225e38ae5d3b02522.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Collect cans of sardines to activate your Ultimate and become invincible for a limited time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into shortcuts! Send your rivals flying. Destroy gimmicks. Catch up in the final stretch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The possibilities are endless. Analyze the situation and create a strategy that's uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ Master Each Course's Unique Gimmicks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.st