lo or With Friends</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills solo or compete against your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's solo play, party play with up to 4 players, and even custom matches with up to 40 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a cross-platform game, so you can play with anyone regardless of platform!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ Extensive Player Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/52eec466c2dd5786f5941c24307f464b.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/52eec466c2dd5786f5941c24307f464b.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/52eec466c2dd5786f5941c24307f464b.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely customize your costumes, carts, ultimate rides, and emotes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't affect performance, so rock your style and dive into the penguins' vacation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Penguin Climbers]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ The plane is leaving without you?! Time for a great escape!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/94bae7ffc195418796a2d8f7737b2d66.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/94bae7ffc195418796a2d8f7737b2d66.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/94bae7ffc195418796a2d8f7737b2d66.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a fun snowy mountain tour, a cliff collapses! It's a disaster! The penguins' desperate (or not) climb begins as they race back to the plane about to depart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb walls with an ice axe, occasionally rescuing friends with a fishing rod, and forge your way through the harsh surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to reach the summit, or challenge yourself solo for a more disciplined climb. Will you safely reunite with the tour conductor and snap a memorable photo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◯ To snowy mountains, jungles, and starlit skies! Explore a mysterious island.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/c587f4109fb0c10acf76a44449f421ce.poster.avif?t=1787213567\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/c587f4109fb0c10acf76a44449f421ce.webm?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/c587f4109fb0c10acf76a44449f421ce.mp4?t=1787213567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The penguins have arrived at the mysterious Enigma Islands, where the terrain changes daily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From giant bird nests and mysterious mech penguins to fishing spots, there are plenty of fascinating places to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, defeat enemies, and experience survival action unlike any race!   </p>", "short_description": "A 40-player survival action race. Stomp rivals, boost speed, chain attacks, and take shortcuts! Master the courses and make split-second decisions to win. The more you play, the deeper the gameplay becomes. It's free to play and cross-platform compatible! Dive in now with players worldwide!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/bf9c67d23b29116453341718f79527d2ab0dc192/header_alt_assets_14.jpg?t=1787213567", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/a4894c38b90d032bdee3e21f051e2103c445c0c4/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_14.jpg?t=1787213567", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/a4894c38b90d032bdee3e21f051e2103c445c0c4/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_14.jpg?t=1787213567", "website": "https://fa